BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chew Toy
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260831T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260831T200000
UID:63cc49523bd102469f2cb9fee5bb15b5@littlejumbobar.com
DESCRIPTION:Chew Toy sounds like backyard nights\, rolling in your favorit
 e smell\, and never says no to treats. It feels energetic\, weird\, and st
 rangely sincere. An experiment gone wonderfully off-script. The sound has 
 teeth. It has that feeling of something playful happening whether the room
  is ready or not. The bass does the stalking and the searching\, sniffing 
 with purpose from one patch of sound to another. The drums provide impact 
 and timing like a series of confident paw taps\, fast when the room flinch
 es\, heavy when it leans in. The saxophone does not politely take turns. I
 t appears\, questions everything\, and then darts away like it has spotted
  a clue no one else can see.\n\nChew Toy’s sets build attention and then
  disturb it. They start clean\, then get stranger\, then get exact about t
 he exact...
LOCATION:Little Jumbo: 241 Broadway St.\, Asheville\, NC 28801
URL:https://www.littlejumbobar.com/events/1877/chew-toy
X-SOURCE:Little Jumbo
END:VEVENT
